                REPLACES the leverage account rather than repairing it.
      0.42..0.58                                -> REFUSED. Both halves move
                alike, so neither position nor rate explains the asymmetry
                and the cause is downstream of this profile.
      anything else                             -> report the number, no
                verdict. This is the 2-3 SE band where a hypothesis is not a
                finding.
    secondary   the centroid's MEASURED position, against the 0.299 the fit
